cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "SCM — Motor de Velos: Environmental Modulation in Galaxy Rotation Curves"
message: "If you use this dataset or code, please cite it as below."
type: software

version: "2.2.0"

abstract: >
  Motor-de-Velos-SCM provides a reproducible, auditable pipeline to evaluate
  galaxy rotation curves under the SCM (Motor de Velos; Fluid Condensation)
  model. Version 2.2.0 formalises E_SCM = log10(MHI/Rdisk^2) as the canonical
  environmental proxy, adds Leave-One-Out generalization tests (RMSE_LOO=0.1464,
  rho_LOO=0.410, p=0.0002, beats permutation null p95=0.1623), and rejects the
  dark-matter halo-dominance hypothesis H1 (f_DM_out p=0.51, DELTA_AIC=-1.62).
  N=79 SPARC galaxies; OLS HC3 regressions; AIC model comparison.

authors:

